# C4 Model - Container Diagram Template

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph "E-Commerce Platform"
        WebApp[Web Application\nReact/TypeScript]
        MobileApp[Mobile App\nReact Native]
        APIGateway[API Gateway\nKong]
        
        subgraph "Services"
            UserSvc[User Service\nGo]
            OrderSvc[Order Service\nJava]
            PaymentSvc[Payment Service\nNode.js]
            InventorySvc[Inventory Service\nPython]
        end
        
        subgraph "Data Stores"
            UserDB[(User DB\nPostgreSQL)]
            OrderDB[(Order DB\nPostgreSQL)]
            Cache[(Cache\nRedis)]
            MessageQ[Message Queue\nKafka]
        end
    end
    
    Customer[Customer] --> WebApp
    Customer --> MobileApp
    Admin[Admin] --> WebApp
    
    WebApp --> APIGateway
    MobileApp --> APIGateway
    
    APIGateway --> UserSvc
    APIGateway --> OrderSvc
    APIGateway --> PaymentSvc
    APIGateway --> InventorySvc
    
    UserSvc --> UserDB
    UserSvc --> Cache
    OrderSvc --> OrderDB
    OrderSvc --> MessageQ
    PaymentSvc --> MessageQ
    InventorySvc --> Cache
    
    style WebApp fill:#1f77b4,color:#fff
    style MobileApp fill:#1f77b4,color:#fff
    style APIGateway fill:#ff7f0e,color:#fff
    style UserSvc fill:#2ca02c,color:#fff
    style OrderSvc fill:#2ca02c,color:#fff
    style PaymentSvc fill:#2ca02c,color:#fff
    style InventorySvc fill:#2ca02c,color:#fff
```

## Usage
Show containers (applications, services, databases) and their interactions.